From: GermanatorLM
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt7996: skip recovery before hardware registration

Return the probe timeout before scheduling mac80211 recovery work.
This guard does not fix the intermittent BE14 initialization failure.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7996/mcu.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt7996/mcu.c
@@ -228,6 +228,9 @@
 	if (!skb) {
 		dev_err(mdev->dev, "Message %08x (seq %d) timeout\n",
 			cmd, seq);
+
+		if (!dev->recovery.hw_init_done)
+			return -ETIMEDOUT;
 
 		if (!test_and_set_bit(MT76_MCU_RESET, &dev->mphy.state)) {
 			dev->recovery.restart = true;
